bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Reply comment 1

actor User
boundary "Chapter Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
control ChapterService
control MangaService
entity ReplyModel
database MongoDB

ReplyService -> ReplyModel: 1. save reply
activate ReplyModel
activate ReplyService
ReplyModel -> MongoDB: 2. insert reply
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReplyModel: 3. savedReply
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyModel --> ReplyService: 4. savedReply
deactivate ReplyModel

opt Create Reply Failed
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 4.1. Error
    activate ReplyController
    ReplyController --> Router: 4.2. 500 Error
    activate Router
    Router --> UI: 4.3 Show error
    activate UI
    UI --> User: 4.4 Error message
    activate User
end

ReplyService -> ChapterService: 5. getChapterById(chapter_id)
activate ChapterService
ChapterService --> ReplyService: 6. chapter
deactivate ChapterService

ReplyService -> MangaService: 7. get author
activate MangaService
MangaService --> ReplyService: 8. manga
deactivate MangaService

opt Invalid manga id
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 8.1. Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 8.2. 400 Error
    deactivate ReplyController
    Router --> UI: 8.3 Show error
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: 8.4 Error message
    deactivate User
    deactivate UI
end
@enduml
